#: octoprint_bambucam/templates/bambucam_settings.jinja2:190
msgid ""
"Off by default: the printer dictates the frame size. Only enable to force"
" a width/height — a value that doesn't match the printer's stream can "
"corrupt the image."
msgstr ""

